          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"about.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg:#fff8f2; --card:#fff; --accent:#c0693b; --muted:#7b5b4a; --soft:#f3e7df; --shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(88,63,48,0.08); --radius:14px; font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial;\\n    }\\n    *{box-sizing:border-box}\\n    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--soft),#fff8f2);color:#3a2b24;line-height:1.45}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:28px 32px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:52px;height:52px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f6d7c6, #e8b79b);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:18px;font-weight:600}\\n    main{max-width:1100px;margin:26px auto;padding:0 24px}\\n    .hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:center}\\n    .hero-card{background:var(--card);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:32px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}\\n    h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:28px;color:#2f231c}\\n    p.lead{margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:12px 18px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-radius:10px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    .meta{font-size:13px;color:#8a6e5e;margin-top:10px}\\n    .avatar{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}\\n    .avatar svg{width:72px;height:72px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fbe9df,#f1cdb8);padding:10px}\\n    section.story{margin-top:28px}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:16px}\\n    .card{background:#fff;border-radius:12px;padding:18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}\\n    .framework{margin-top:30px}\\n    .pill{display:inline-block;background:#fff0ea;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;color:var(--accent);font-weight:700}\\n    footer{margin:40px 0 80px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)}\\n    /* organic pattern */\\n    .pattern{position:absolute;right:-60px;top:120px;opacity:0.08}\\n    @media(max-width:900px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-bottom:20px}.hero svg{display:none}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"logo\\\">W</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Paths</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Work With Me</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <div class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"hero-card\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"avatar\\\">\\n          <!-- unique inline avatar SVG (assets/img/avatar.svg) -->\\n          <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 64 64\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n            <defs>\\n              <linearGradient id=\\\"g1\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\" y1=\\\"0\\\" y2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#f7e6dc\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#f2c8ad\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n            </defs>\\n            <rect width=\\\"64\\\" height=\\\"64\\\" rx=\\\"12\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g1)\\\"/>\\n            <circle cx=\\\"32\\\" cy=\\\"24\\\" r=\\\"10\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.9\\\"/>\\n            <path d=\\\"M16 50c0-8 16-10 16-10s16 2 16 10v2H16v-2z\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.9\\\"/>\\n            <circle cx=\\\"26\\\" cy=\\\"22\\\" r=\\\"1.6\\\" fill=\\\"#c07b5d\\\"/>\\n            <circle cx=\\\"38\\\" cy=\\\"22\\\" r=\\\"1.6\\\" fill=\\\"#c07b5d\\\"/>\\n          </svg>\\n          <div>\\n            <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{COACH_NAME}}, <span style=\\\"font-weight:600\\\">{{CREDENTIALS}}</span></div>\\n            <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Based in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}} • {{PHONE}} • <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <h1>I help busy people build steady wellbeing habits</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Practical coaching that treats daily routines as the foundation for real, lasting change — gentle structure, flexible tools.</p>\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        <div class=\\\"meta\\\">Free guide: \\\"Five Simple Habits to Stabilize Your Energy\\\" included with every inquiry.</div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- decorative hero SVG (assets/img/hero.svg) -->\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:center\\\">\\n        <svg width=\\\"420\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 420 300\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n          <defs>\\n            <linearGradient id=\\\"hg\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#ffeade\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#f6c8aa\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n          </defs>\\n          <rect x=\\\"0\\\" y=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"420\\\" height=\\\"300\\\" rx=\\\"24\\\" fill=\\\"url(#hg)\\\" />\\n          <g fill=\\\"#fff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.9\\\">\\n            <rect x=\\\"36\\\" y=\\\"36\\\" width=\\\"160\\\" height=\\\"110\\\" rx=\\\"12\\\" />\\n            <rect x=\\\"220\\\" y=\\\"56\\\" width=\\\"140\\\" height=\\\"52\\\" rx=\\\"10\\\" />\\n            <circle cx=\\\"300\\\" cy=\\\"210\\\" r=\\\"52\\\" />\\n          </g>\\n          <path d=\\\"M20 250c60-40 180-60 320-40\\\" stroke=\\\"#c0693b\\\" stroke-width=\\\"6\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/>\\n        </svg>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"story\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"pill\\\">My approach</div>\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">A human-first coaching story</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"lead\\\">I began coaching because the available options were either rigid or vague. I built a middle path: clear, behavior-forward frameworks that respect your life rhythms. No miracle promises — just steady work and measurable progress.</p>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>Where I start</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">We map one week of routines, identify friction points, then select three micro-habits we can test for two weeks.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n          <strong>What clients see</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Improved energy consistency, fewer decision-fatigue moments, and a clearer sense of what actually supports your wellbeing.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"framework\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"pill\\\">Core framework</div>\\n      <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">The SLOW Framework — small, lined, observable, weekly</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"lead\\\">SLOW is a practical rhythm: Small tests, Lined schedules, Observable signals, Weekly reflection. It keeps change predictable and sustainable.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:14px;flex-wrap:wrap\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:200px\\\"><strong>Small</strong><p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">A micro-habit is more likely to stick than a big plan.</p></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:200px\\\"><strong>Lined</strong><p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">We put actions into visible slots in your day — not vague intentions.</p></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:200px\\\"><strong>Observable</strong><p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Metrics you can notice without tracking apps.</p></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"flex:1;min-width:200px\\\"><strong>Weekly</strong><p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Short reflection keeps momentum and rapid learning.</p></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:26px\\\">\\n      <h3>What’s next?</h3>\\n      <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Explore tailored paths or schedule a brief consult to see how SLOW maps to your life.</p>\\n      <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Explore Paths</a>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:28px\\\">\\n      <h3>Kind words</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\"><em>“Practical guidance that actually fit my workweek — I finally sleep better.”</em><div style=\\\"margin-top:10px;font-weight:700\\\">— A client in {{CITY}}</div></div>\\n        <div class=\\\"card\\\"><em>“No fluff, just tools I could test each week.”</em><div style=\\\"margin-top:10px;font-weight:700\\\">— Another client</div></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>Ready to start? <a href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Book a discovery call</a> • <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Contact</a></div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted)\\\">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"services.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Services — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fffaf6;--card:#fff;--accent:#a85a33;--muted:#6d5a4e;--soft:#f7e1d6;--radius:12px;--shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(104,68,52,0.08);font-family: Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Arial}\\n    body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#35261f}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:20px 28px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fbd9c8,#e7ab8c);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:700}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:16px}\\n    main{max-width:1100px;margin:24px auto;padding:0 24px}\\n    .intro{display:flex;gap:22px;align-items:center}\\n    .intro-card{background:var(--card);padding:22px;border-radius:16px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}\\n    h1{margin:0;color:#2e241e;font-size:26px}\\n    p.lead{color:var(--muted)}\\n    .services{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .service{background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#fffaf0);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(168,90,51,0.06)}\\n    .service h3{margin:0 0 8px}\\n    .service p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    .faq{margin-top:28px}\\n    .faq h4{margin-bottom:8px}\\n    .pattern{margin-top:14px;opacity:0.06}\\n    @media(max-width:900px){.services{grid-template-columns:1fr}.intro{flex-direction:column}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"logo\\\">W</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Start</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">My Story</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"programs.html\\\">Programs</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Reach Out</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <div class=\\\"intro\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"intro-card\\\" style=\\\"flex:1\\\">\\n        <h1>Services designed for everyday life</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Short engagements and longer courses — each service centers habit formation and measurable outcomes, not quick fixes.</p>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n          <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- decorative pattern SVG (assets/img/pattern.svg) -->\\n      <div style=\\\"width:260px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\\\">\\n        <svg width=\\\"260\\\" height=\\\"200\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 260 200\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n          <defs>\\n            <linearGradient id=\\\"pg\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#f8e4d9\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#f2c1a2\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n          </defs>\\n          <rect width=\\\"260\\\" height=\\\"200\\\" rx=\\\"20\\\" fill=\\\"url(#pg)\\\" />\\n          <g fill=\\\"#fff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.9\\\">\\n            <ellipse cx=\\\"60\\\" cy=\\\"60\\\" rx=\\\"44\\\" ry=\\\"28\\\"/>\\n            <rect x=\\\"120\\\" y=\\\"40\\\" width=\\\"100\\\" height=\\\"60\\\" rx=\\\"10\\\"/>\\n            <path d=\\\"M30 160c40-30 140-40 190-10\\\" stroke=\\\"#a85a33\\\" stroke-width=\\\"5\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/>\\n          </g>\\n        </svg>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <h2>Offerings</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Choose the format that fits your schedule and goals — single sessions, progressive coaching, or group workshops.</p>\\n      <div class=\\\"services\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n          <h3>1:1 Short Sprint</h3>\\n          <p>Three sessions over four weeks. Ideal for testing a new habit or stabilizing a routine quickly.</p>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">Includes a habit worksheet and a weekly check-in plan.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n          <h3>Deep Coaching</h3>\\n          <p>12-week collaboration focused on building a sustainable life rhythm. Includes email support and weekly reflection prompts.</p>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">Great for clients ready to transform several routines simultaneously.</div>\\n        </div>\\n        <div class=\\\"service\\\">\\n          <h3>Group Workshops</h3>\\n          <p>Hands-on workshops (90–120 minutes) that teach practical habit design for teams or friend groups.</p>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">Customizable for workplaces in {{CITY}}.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"faq\\\">\\n      <h3>Common questions</h3>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <h4>How quickly do people notice results?</h4>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Many notice small shifts within two weeks when we test one micro-habit at a time. Bigger rhythm changes take longer.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <h4>Do you prescribe meal or exercise plans?</h4>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">No. Coaching focuses on habits and systems you can sustain in daily life, not prescriptive medical or nutrition plans.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <h4>Is this remote?</h4>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Yes — most work is virtual. In-person offerings for local clients in {{CITY}} are available on request.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:26px\\\">\\n      <h3>Packages as paths</h3>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:10px\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);min-width:220px\\\">\\n          <strong>Starter Path</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">Single-session + plan—great first step.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);min-width:220px\\\">\\n          <strong>Momentum Path</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">8-week coaching to lock in several habits.</p>\\n        </div>\\n        <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);min-width:220px\\\">\\n          <strong>Transform Path</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px\\\">12-week comprehensive plan with weekly reviews.</p>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <strong>Interested in a tailored plan?</strong>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">Send a quick note — include what’s most important to you right now.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer style=\\\"margin-top:36px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n      <div>Questions? Call {{PHONE}} or <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">email</a>.</div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"programs.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\" />\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\" />\\n  <title>Programs — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#fff7f1;--accent:#c46a41;--muted:#6f5748;--card:#fff;--radius:14px;--shadow:0 12px 36px rgba(104,68,52,0.09);font-family:Inter, system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Arial}\\n    body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:#362a22}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:22px 28px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f9dccb,#e8b79b);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:#fff;font-weight:800}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:16px}\\n    main{max-width:1100px;margin:20px auto;padding:0 24px}\\n    .top{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center}\\n    .top .intro{flex:1}\\n    h1{margin:0;font-size:28px}\\n    .summary{color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px}\\n    .program-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px;margin-top:18px}\\n    .program{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);border:1px solid rgba(196,106,65,0.06)}\\n    .program h3{margin:0 0 6px}\\n    .program p{margin:0;color:var(--muted)}\\n    .price{margin-top:12px;font-weight:800;color:#2f221b}\\n    .lead-magnet{margin-top:26px;padding:16px;background:#fff7f0;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(196,106,65,0.06)}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:12px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:#fff;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    .testimonials{margin-top:26px}\\n    @media(max-width:900px){.program-list{grid-template-columns:1fr}.top{flex-direction:column}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"logo\\\">W</div>\\n      <div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-weight:800\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Overview</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"about.html\\\">About</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"services.html\\\">Work With Me</a>\\n      <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Book</a>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <main>\\n    <div class=\\\"top\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"intro\\\">\\n        <h1>Programs: find your steady path</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"summary\\\">Programs emphasize habit sequences and small experiments — built around measurable weekly outcomes, not abstract goals.</p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <!-- small organic hero / pattern SVG (inline unique) -->\\n      <div style=\\\"width:200px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center\\\">\\n        <svg width=\\\"200\\\" height=\\\"140\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 200 140\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\\n          <defs>\\n            <linearGradient id=\\\"ph\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\"><stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#fbe7dd\\\"/><stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#f2c3a6\\\"/></linearGradient>\\n          </defs>\\n          <rect width=\\\"200\\\" height=\\\"140\\\" rx=\\\"18\\\" fill=\\\"url(#ph)\\\"/>\\n          <g fill=\\\"#fff\\\" opacity=\\\"0.95\\\">\\n            <rect x=\\\"18\\\" y=\\\"18\\\" width=\\\"120\\\" height=\\\"36\\\" rx=\\\"10\\\"/>\\n            <circle cx=\\\"150\\\" cy=\\\"100\\\" r=\\\"26\\\"/>\\n            <path d=\\\"M10 120c50-30 120-45 180-20\\\" stroke=\\\"#c46a41\\\" stroke-width=\\\"4\\\" fill=\\\"none\\\" stroke-linecap=\\\"round\\\"/>\\n          </g>\\n        </svg>\\n      </div>\\n    </div>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n      <h2 style=\\\"margin-bottom:8px\\\">Available paths</h2>\\n      <p class=\\\"summary\\\">Each path names a focus and the expected change over the first 8–12 weeks. Choose what feels most urgent and we’ll adapt it to your schedule.</p>\\n\\n      <div class=\\\"program-list\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"program\\\">\\n          <h3>Rhythm Reset (8 weeks)</h3>\\n          <p>Rebuild daily anchors: morning, midday, and evening rituals that remove decision friction.</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"price\\\">Investment: Tiered starting at $850</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Request this path</a></div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"program\\\">\\n          <h3>Energy Stabilizer (12 weeks)</h3>\\n          <p>Target consistent energy with small habit loops, sleep hygiene tweaks, and weekly reflection markers.</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"price\\\">Investment: Tiered starting at $1,450</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Start a consult</a></div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"program\\\">\\n          <h3>Focus Builder (6 weeks)</h3>\\n          <p>Short program to create a lasting focus block schedule and support rituals to reduce distraction.</p>\\n          <div class=\\\"price\\\">Investment: $620</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Book Focus Builder</a></div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"lead-magnet\\\">\\n      <strong>Lead magnet</strong>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Grab the free PDF: \\\"7 Tiny Tests to Improve Your Week\\\" — a short workbook you can use this week to see which small shifts stick.</p>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\"><a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Get the workbook</a></div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"testimonials\\\">\\n      <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:20px\\\">What clients say</h3>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:12px\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)\\\"><em>“My mornings used to be chaotic — now I have a short ritual that sets my tone for the whole day.”</em><div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;font-weight:700\\\">— Client in {{CITY}}</div></div>\\n        <div style=\\\"background:#fff;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)\\\"><em>“The weekly experiments made change feel safe and reversible — which meant I actually tried things.”</em><div style=\\\"margin-top:8px;font-weight:700\\\">— Another client</div></div>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px\\\">\\n      <h3>Program FAQs</h3>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n        <h4>How does pricing work?</h4>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Programs are offered in tiers: core coaching, core+support (email between sessions), and premium (extra check-ins). We discuss which tier fits your needs during a discovery call.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n        <h4>Can I switch paths mid-program?</h4>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">Yes — we adapt. The goal is progress, not strict adherence to an initial label.</p>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:18px;background:#fff;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <strong>Ready to choose a path?</strong>\\n        <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px\\\">Book a 20-minute discovery call and we'll match you to a program and tier.</p>\\n      </div>\\n      <div>\\n        <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\">Book discovery call</a>\\n      </div>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer style=\\\"margin-top:36px;text-align:center;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n      <div>Questions? Call {{PHONE}} or <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\">email</a>.</div>\\n      <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">© {{BUSINESS_NAME}} • {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </main>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
        }
      ],
